OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian killed after collision
OL,4,Awith car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman in her sixties has died
OL,7,Ffollowing a road traffic collision in
OL,8,FAghagallon, County Antrim.
OL,10,FPolice received a report at about 14:50
OL,11,FBST on Friday of a collision involving
OL,12,Fa pedestrian and an Audi Q3 on the
OL,13,FLurgan Road.
OL,15,FEmergency services attended but the
OL,16,Fwoman was pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,18,FThe driver of the car, a 34-year-old
OL,19,Fman, has been arrested and remains in
OL,20,Fcustody.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
